{"v":4,"catch":"八位降臨人間戰鬥的天使，如今……","desc":"《TOUKI DENSHOU ANGEL EYES》是TECMO於1996年發行的一款格鬥遊戲。\n玩家必須與強大的對手進行激烈的戰鬥以獲得“Archangel”的稱號。\n當你的情緒指標達到頂峰時，你可以使用超級特殊動作和特殊技巧在戰鬥中獲得優勢。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-10-20","genres":["格鬥","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91ccf818062b336a1ee31caa24e7eaa45f8e7228bfa285c7e3c9447f3de967de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1a2696a44066d1c70b32f956b771e582effe4d2595e6c20c72f4bd319e2e0fc6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d0579579dab7f70fb05ee9b2a3574c5daffcf78290baac4178f5733a37e5419.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65f660bdee61a52c9f2c2c4db45fc41f56b892b805a975caf21913d0f0822b43.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/30d89c4f0cc98ce26a5971a6c365eaba690f798668740f70a3fcdbf29868b4e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5f68b86b59d01657e5a1946f781d443d39e296f06a2bfdc657407bb5567d704.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ed10189c8000","dlc":[]}